{"id":76,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自学自習と異文化理解で伸びる教育","feature_description":"公文国際学園中等部・高等部は、自学自習を土台に、一人ひとりが主体的に学ぶ姿勢を育てる学校です。国際理解、多様な背景を持つ仲間との生活、探究的な学びを通して、自分で課題を見つけ考える力を養います。知識の習得にとどまらず、自立した学習者として社会に関わる力を伸ばします。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":951,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":952,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":953,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":954,"name":"ダンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":955,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":956,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":957,"name":"バトミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":958,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":959,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":960,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":961,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":962,"name":"囲碁将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":963,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部",